#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:8
msgid "auditd-support interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The `auditd-support` interface permits snaps to operate as the [`auditd`]"
"(https://www.man7.org/linux/man-pages/man8/auditd.8.html) service on the "
"system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:12
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:14
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:14
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:27
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:29
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:18
msgid ""
"The `auditd-support` plug is {ref}`unsupported for parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-unsupported>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:21
msgid ""
"Unlike other `*-support` interfaces, there is no single official `auditd` "
"snap for which this interface was intended to be used. Instead, snap "
"packagers who wish to ship their own snap containing `auditd` or serving the "
"role of `auditd` may request installation and connection of this interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:23
msgid ""
"The `auditd-support` interface grants access to the [`CAP_AUDIT_CONTROL` "
"capability](https://www.man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/capabilities.7.html), "
"along with access to files commonly required by `auditd`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:25
msgid "Code examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:27
msgid ""
"The test code can be found in the snapd repository:</br>https://github.com/"
"canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/auditd_support_test.go"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/auditd-support-interface.md:29
msgid ""
"The source code for the interface is in the snapd repository: </br>https://"
"github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/auditd_support.go"
msgstr ""
